Package: polaros-archive-keyring
Version: 1.0.0
Architecture: all
Maintainer: PolarOS Team <dev@polaros.dev>
Installed-Size: 12
Depends: gpgv
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/polaros
Description: GnuPG archive key of the PolarOS repository
 Contains the public key used to verify the Release file of the PolarOS
 apt repository. Install it and reference the keyring explicitly in
 /etc/apt/sources.list.d/polaros.sources:
 .
 deb [signed-by=/usr/share/keyrings/polaros-archive-keyring.gpg]
   https://repo.polaros.dev trixie main
